1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:03,480
(Penny:)Seriously?
You went first after only two weeks?

2
00:00:03,651 --> 00:00:05,401
(Penny:)That's bold.

3
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:07,450
(Leonard:)It's not bold, it's a mistake.

4
00:00:07,613 --> 00:00:09,403
(Leonard:)I didn't change my status.

5
00:00:09,574 --> 00:00:11,574
(Penny:)Well, then who did?

6
00:00:15,913 --> 00:00:19,373
(Sheldon:)I had no choice. He cried in front of her.

7
00:00:20,293 --> 00:00:22,583
(Leonard:)You hacked my Facebook account?

8
00:00:22,753 --> 00:00:28,013
(Sheldon:)Oh, it's hardly hacking when you use
the same password for everything, Kal-El.

9
00:00:28,676 --> 00:00:32,016
(Leonard:)Are you insane?
Now she's gonna think I'm desperate.

10
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:34,260
(Leonard:)You've destroyed this relationship.

11
00:00:34,432 --> 00:00:36,142
And you wanna know
the worst part?

12
00:00:36,309 --> 00:00:38,559
You don't understand
what you did wrong...

13
00:00:38,728 --> 00:00:43,028
(Leonard:)...because you can't conceive of something
that you are not an expert in.

14
00:00:43,191 --> 00:00:45,941
- In which I am not an expert.
- Don't even...

15
00:00:48,905 --> 00:00:50,825
Don't wanna hear another word
out of you.

16
00:00:50,990 --> 00:00:52,530
(Leonard:)Ooh.

17
00:00:54,535 --> 00:00:57,535
(Penny(after Raj lets out a noise):)What's wrong, Lassie?
Timmy fall down the well?

18
00:01:00,666 --> 00:01:02,086
(Penny(after Raj lets out a noise):)Oh, wow.

19
00:01:02,251 --> 00:01:04,421
(Penny(after Raj lets out a noise):)She just updated her Facebook status.

20
00:01:04,837 --> 00:01:08,927
"Stephanie Barnett is in a relationship
with Leonard Hofstadter."

21
00:01:10,259 --> 00:01:11,299
(Penny:)Really?

22
00:01:13,804 --> 00:01:15,304
(Leonard:)Oh, look at that.

23
00:01:15,473 --> 00:01:17,513
I have a girlfriend. Ha, ha.

24
00:01:18,267 --> 00:01:19,937
(Sheldon:)If I am permitted to speak again...

25
00:01:20,102 --> 00:01:23,652
(Sheldon:)...Dr. Sheldon Cooper for the win.

